# agent-refactor skill 的状态与产物（队列、可达图、扫描结果、差分 spec）
.agent-refactor/

# ── 模型的错误史:可丢弃,故意不跟踪 ──
# MODEL.md 2026-08-09 从 809 行砍到 175:规格留下,而「这条曾经是错的、被什么
# 推翻」那部分整段移到这里。它对查案有用,对规格没用,而且**模型确认之后就删**。
# 单列一条而不是忽略整个 docs/ —— docs/ 里那十个跟踪着的文件是有人会读的散文,
# 而这一个不是。
docs/model_error_history.md

# ── 上游 Kava4 脚本:2.8 MB 的第三方 Lua,不进 git ──
# 它是 tools/import_kava4.py 的输入,不是这个仓库的源码,而钩子对 2 MB 以上的
# 新文件说不——那条规矩是对的。**记录不在这个文件里**:docs/kava4/patterns.json
# (解析产物,跟踪着) 记着每把枪的逐步 dy、17 ms 网格和 kava 标量,
# tools/import_kava4.py 的文件头记着 URL 和它自己的 sha256。
# 要重新取:见 import_kava4.py 缺文件时打印的那条 curl。
docs/kava4/*.lua

# ⚠ ONE EXCEPTION TO `*.png`, and it is evidence rather than a corpus.
# docs/p90_has_no_slots.png is the two-frame strip that settles whether the p90
# has a scope slot -- detector/attachment_catalog.py cites it for an entry that
# decides whether a drag happens, and a drag at a slot that does not exist
# drops the part (or the gun) on the ground. The source frames live under
# calibration/artifacts, which IS ignored, so without this line the only copy
# of the answer is one cleanup away from gone -- exactly how 40 weapons' curves
# were lost while `git status` stayed clean.
!docs/p90_has_no_slots.png
!docs/p90_no_slots_0802_scan.png

# The agent-refactor tool's working directory (scan output, run state).
.agent-refactor/
